%% Job lifecycle state machine (SRS REQ-INT-04, REQ-RES-03, REQ-QG-02; ICD §15)
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Received : intake accepted and normalised
    Received --> Resolving : resolve_parcel task

    Resolving --> AwaitingCustomerInput : multiple plausible candidates
    AwaitingCustomerInput --> Resolving : customer selection recorded
    Resolving --> RoutingJurisdiction : single confirmed identity

    RoutingJurisdiction --> Fetching : planning authority resolved
    RoutingJurisdiction --> Fetching : authority unresolved — jurisdiction findings flagged

    Fetching --> Screening : fetch_source tasks complete
    Screening --> QualityGates : screen_profile complete

    QualityGates --> AutoPublish : identity + license + all mandatory gates pass
    QualityGates --> QualifiedOutput : non-mandatory gaps disclosed
    QualityGates --> HumanReview : mandatory stale / material conflict
    QualityGates --> Blocked : unresolved identity or denied right

    HumanReview --> AutoPublish : reviewer approves
    HumanReview --> QualifiedOutput : approved with qualifications
    HumanReview --> Blocked : reviewer rejects

    AutoPublish --> Fetching : rescreen (e.g. records request fulfilled)
    QualifiedOutput --> Fetching : rescreen
    HumanReview --> Fetching : rescreen

    AutoPublish --> Published : report rendered + manifest
    QualifiedOutput --> Published : report rendered + manifest
    Published --> [*]
    Blocked --> [*]

    note right of AwaitingCustomerInput
        Job state, not a task (ICD §8).
        SLA clock pauses for customer input
        and pending records requests.
    end note

    note right of Blocked
        Never published silently.
        Reason recorded in audit trail.
    end note
